        "mempool": []
      },
      "note": "BIP-54 template stamping nLockTime = height - 1 with a non-final input sequence, as it lands in block H_a + 2 (1,000,002) where the value is 1,000,001. Without the exemption the raw predicate calls 1,000,002..1,000,010 non-final -- 600 * 1,000,001 = 600,000,600 is not exceeded by T(1,000,002) = 600,000,120, and the equality case at 1,000,010 is non-final too -- recovering only at 1,000,011. The bypass makes every block final, which is what keeps those templates valid."
