      "note": "The other half of the BIP-54 pair: block H_a + 1 carries nLockTime = 1,000,000, whose boundary 600,000,000 is already cleared by T(1,000,001) = 600,000,060, so the raw predicate would call this block final on its own. Pinned to show the exemption is not needed here -- and, with the twin below, that it is a scope restriction rather than a value-dependent special case."
